mach1
=====

This product is named mach1. It is not Airwindows and is not titled Mackity.

Airwindows Mackity
------------------

The saturator algorithm/source is derived from Airwindows Mackity, which is
licensed under the MIT license. Airwindows Mackity is attributed here as that
algorithm/source only; it is not this product’s name or brand.

